 "poem": "Fragments of a youth, far relieved be\nFrom his former sins, and blest regenerate;\nThee shall by Nature thus recompense thee,\nAnd yet have chance to do me more appropriate,\nBy thy bosom may the wine of salvation\nTo my heart withal be added me.\nMay the Spirit of Solitude again\nTurn from this weak world; and let Hope decree\nHeaven for us to reign in our salvation.\nGreat is thy mission here; great also be\nThe tasks which thou dost perform. And again\nThou shalt be a mighty hero the",
